Mr. White,
Thank you for submitting your public records request to the Oregon Parks an=
d Recreation Department (OPRD).
Expect to hear back from us in about 10 business days with any records that=
 match your request or, for larger requests, with an estimate for staff tim=
e and costs to gather the documents.
Thank you,
Katie Gauthier
Oregon Parks and Recreation Department






From: Robert Samuel White <rsw@rswfire.com>
Sent: Saturday, May 2, 2026 6:34 PM
To: PUBLICRECORDS Oprd * OPRD <oprd.publicrecords@oprd.oregon.gov>
Cc: PUBLICCOMMENT Oprc * OPRD <oprc.publiccomment@oprd.oregon.gov>; Governo=
r Kotek * GOV <governor.kotek@oregon.gov>; marissa@tinafororegon.com
Subject: Public Records Request =97 Agency Compliance and Executive Involve=
ment in PRR Processing, January 1, 2023 to Present



You don't often get email from rsw@rswfire.com<mailto:rsw@rswfire.com>. Lea=
rn why this is important<https://aka.ms/LearnAboutSenderIdentification>

To Whom It May Concern,



Pursuant to ORS 192.311 et seq., I am requesting the following records:



All public records requests received by the Oregon Parks and Recreation Dep=
artment from January 1, 2023 to present, including for each: the date recei=
ved, the date of agency response, the method of production (electronic or p=
hysical mail), whether a fee was assessed, whether a fee waiver was request=
ed, whether a fee waiver was granted, and whether the request was fulfilled=
 in whole, in part, or denied.



All written policies, procedures, or guidelines governing the agency's resp=
onse to public records requests, including any internal guidance on product=
ion format, fee assessment, and timeline compliance.



All records reflecting instances where the agency missed the statutory five=
-business-day response deadline under ORS 192.324, from January 1, 2023 to =
present.



All records reflecting the involvement of the OPRD Director, OPRD Interim D=
irector, or OPRD Deputy Director in the review, approval, or direction of r=
esponses to public records requests from January 1, 2023 to present, includ=
ing any communications in which executive staff directed the content, timin=
g, or format of a response.



All records reflecting communications between OPRD legal counsel and execut=
ive staff regarding public records requests, including any guidance on with=
holding, delaying, or limiting production of records.



All records reflecting instances where OPRD legal counsel reviewed a public=
 records request prior to response, from January 1, 2023 to present.



I request that responsive records be produced on a rolling basis as they ar=
e identified rather than held until the request is fully processed.



Please be advised that I expect all records potentially responsive to this =
request to be preserved immediately. Any destruction, deletion, modificatio=
n, or alteration of responsive records following receipt of this request ma=
y constitute spoliation and will be treated accordingly.



If any record or portion of a record is withheld, I require the following f=
or each withheld item: the specific statutory exemption claimed, the date o=
f the record, the author, and all recipients. A blanket exemption claim is =
insufficient and will not be accepted as compliance.



I am requesting a fee waiver on the grounds that this request serves the pu=
blic interest by enabling public oversight of agency compliance with Oregon=
 public records law. This request is not commercial in nature. Responsive r=
ecords will be used to inform and supplement a public archive documenting i=
nstitutional conduct, accessible at oprdvolunteerabuse.org. Public access t=
o this information advances transparency and accountability in government.



I am further requesting that all responsive records be produced electronica=
lly in PDF or equivalent digital format and delivered to rsw@rswfire.com<ma=
ilto:rsw@rswfire.com>.



Please confirm receipt of this request in writing within the statutory five=
-business-day window pursuant to ORS 192.324.



Robert Samuel White

P.O. Box 334

Reedsport, Oregon 97467

rsw@rswfire.com<mailto:rsw@rswfire.com>

